    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報352期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你kám bat tī熱--人好天ê暗頭仔去廟口看戲？〈大戲〉是leh寫對siáng ê思念？〈Siàu念囡仔時〉ná一幅色水飽tīnn油彩畫，kā m̄甘放bē記--得--ê，lóng裝框收藏。Hip熱ê天氣逐家lóng tsiok需要來一杯透心涼--ê，你kám愛lim茶？〈做茶〉有偌厚工？有啥mih學問？鼻著〈熟sāi ê氣味〉，一家伙仔鬥陣、甜but-but ê回憶hōo心肝頭隨燒lō--起-來。Beh煮好料ài先有好ê食材，〈學曝菜脯〉是有啥mê角iah撇步？是啥mih款煮食ê手路tsiah有才調〈Kap白菜滷結緣〉？食飽飽了tsiah來繼續學台語mā bē siunn uànn。〈Koh做一擺學生，tsiânn好〉kā決心beh進修台語ê機緣kap收成，lóng講hōo你聽。Mā有人講〈我ê台文路uì tī紐約做爸母開始〉，m̄管離故鄉偌遠、mā無論年歲偌濟，若知影thang開始就是好時機！</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj_HGAm2Z1q0Z-0tm9SqhesmnGMDqFr-QPwxMuwxpLmhUcyep6Yu9eC7pYoynSFcQmWfPISoGpFRxDqjPT3XVtD_4fUDm7iM21i5ytGXSu-sEMGtqZ6TfrW_Kn0OMse4UdRC5oh6VGuBl22pGpaUnFf0Wftu72NN9Qwdl9VgUshvYLKUNNQRV4Y-MNnH5-8/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1352%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E5%AE%A4%C3%AA%E8%A9%B1.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj_HGAm2Z1q0Z-0tm9SqhesmnGMDqFr-QPwxMuwxpLmhUcyep6Yu9eC7pYoynSFcQmWfPISoGpFRxDqjPT3XVtD_4fUDm7iM21i5ytGXSu-sEMGtqZ6TfrW_Kn0OMse4UdRC5oh6VGuBl22pGpaUnFf0Wftu72NN9Qwdl9VgUshvYLKUNNQRV4Y-MNnH5-8/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1352%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E5%AE%A4%C3%AA%E8%A9%B1.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg-lYVj5iXSpkf3r_C-YCLYn41k16PH64OPzdJOK9cMMVAwd1tATd4flar